Each time your shed skin looses [49%, 37%, 30%, 26%, 23% (TL1-5)] of its max power or you take damage over 15% of your maximum life a black putrescent pustule grows on your body for 5 turns.

Each pustule increases all your resistances by [3%, 4%, 5%, 6%, 6% (TL1-5; SP 100)]. You can have up to [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] pustules at once.

Resistance scales with your Spellpower.
